  "_README": {
    "what": "Crime and Punishment: the sentencing reel plus the consequence table.",
    "phases": "A verdict has two halves. The reel decides the SENTENCE (what the court makes you do). The injury table decides the CONSEQUENCE (what it costs your body).",
    "sentences": "Ported from the standalone Wheel of Regret prototype (incoming/). 89 sentences across mild/moderate/severe/weird/special, severity 1-10.",
